  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1202.64 External floating roof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1202.64 \"External floating roof\" means the cover of an open-top storage tank, which consists of a double deck or pontoon single deck that rests upon and is supported by the VOL being contained, and that is equipped with a closure seal to close the space between the roof edge and tank shell.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
